#5701
Tavis Burdun Firbolg Scout~
Tavis Burdun~
Tavis Burdun, the Firbolg Scout, scouts the area.~
Tavis Burdun scouts the territory around you.  He wields a large hickory 
bow called Bear Driller.  He stands 8 feet tall, small for a firbolg, and 
his bow is a foot taller than him.~
ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_STEALTH|AFF_TONGUES|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_DETECT_INVIS
0 S
95 BODY_HAND BODY_HAND|BODY_FOOT 10d10+9900 3d10+75
1000 RACE_OGRE
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>speech_prog help~
if quest(0, 4, $n) == 3
  mpoload 5716
  emote reaches back and gets an arrow from his quiver.
  give i5716 $n
  drop i5716
  say $n, this is a rune arrow that Basil the Verbeeg has made.
  say It is explosive and may help you kill the traitor.
  say To activate it you have to think BASILISWISE.
  say I have sent my charge Avner to find out who the traitor is.
  mpmset $n quest 0 4 4
endif
~
>death_prog 100~
if quest(5, 4, $n) == 2
  if quest(10, 1, $n) == 0
    shout NO! I have failed you my Queen!
    mpmset $n quest 10 1 1
  endif
endif
if rand (1)
  mpoload 5733
endif
~
|
#5702
Basil verbeeg~
Basil the Verbeeg~
Basil the Verbeeg stands here.~
He stands 9 feet tall, with gangling arms, bowed legs and huge feet
as flat as a beavers tail.  He looks gaunt and half starved, with a
distended belly and stooped shoulders.  A scrawny beard hangs from his
chin while his thick lips give him an affable yet oddly sly smile.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SCAVENGER|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
0 S
95 BODY_HEAD BODY_HAND 10d10+9900 2d7+85
100000 RACE_OGRE
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>greet_prog 100~
if quest(0, 4, $n) == 2
  say Ahhhh, $n, Queen Brianna has sent you?
  say Go find Tavis Burdun, Lord Scout, he has some rune 
  say arrows that I have made that you can use when killing 
  say the traitor. 
  mpmset $n quest 0 4 3
else
  if quest(0, 4, $n) == 8
    if sex($n) == 1
      say Welcome Lord $n of Hartsvale.
    else
      say Welcome Lady $n of Hartsvale.
    endif
  else
    say The Queen is worried, $n.
    mpecho Basil marks runes onto an arrow.
  endif
endif
~
>death_prog 1~
mpoload 5733
~
>rand_prog 5~
say Do you need any runes drawn?
~
>speech_prog yes~
say Well I have a few runes available to you for a price.
mpforce $n list
~
