#5703
prince arlien gilthwit~
Prince Arlien of Gilthwit~
Prince Arlien of Gilthwit stands here.~
He is a swarthy handsome man with dark curly hair and a cleft chin.  His 
brown eyes watch you alertly and measures you up.  He wears a servicable 
heavy plate armour and a helmet with wicked looking horns.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_HUNT|AFF_TONGUES
