#5704
goboka ogre shaman~
Goboka the Ogre Shaman~
Goboka the Ogre Shaman stands here.~
He is a huge ogre with skin as brown as an acorn.  He stands about 10 feet 
tall.  He wears the skin of an enormous white bear over his shoulders and 
a human thigh bone through his greasy topknot.  He smiles at you and 
reveals a mouth filled with ugly orange fangs.~
