#5706
julien arno ettin~
Julien and Arno~
Julien and Arno, the ettin looms over you.~
He is the original ettin, servant of the titan.  You recognise one of 
his heads, Julien, as being an enlarged version of the handsome Prince 
Arlien.  The other head, Arno, is ugly and doesn't seem as intelligent 
as Julien.~
