#5707
titan twilight~
The Titan of Twilight~
The Titan of Twilight stands here.~
He is majestically robed and larger than a castle.  In fact he is so
big he could pluck castle towers from the ground like you would pluck
a flower.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
-1000 S
95 BODY_FOOT BODY_FOOT 10d10+14000 2d10+75
333208 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>greet_prog 100~
if quest(0, 4, $n) == 6
  say You killed my faithful servant.  You will die!
  mpkill $n
else
  if quest(0, 4, $n) == 7
    say You killed my faithful servant.  You will die!
    mpkill $n
  else
    if quest(5, 4, $n) == 0
      say We need to bring Brianna of Hartwick to the 
      say Twilight Vale.  But we have been having 
      say difficulty getting her here.
      say Are you prepared to help us?
    else
      if quest(5, 4, $n) == 6
        say Ahh so you have brought the Queen to me $n.
        mpecho The Queen comes out of her daze and screams in terror.
        mpechoat $n The Queen gives you a look of betrayal.
        mpecho The Titan orders servants to take the Queen away.
        mpechoat $n The titan turns to you.
        say Now for your reward $n.
        mpechoat $n The titan laughs at you diabolically.
        mpmset $n quest 5 4 7
        rescale 5707 $n 80
        mpkill $n
      endif
    endif
  endif
~
>speech_prog yes~
if quest(5, 4, $n) == 0
  say Go see my servant the ettin, Julien and Arno
  say and ask him for help.
  mpmset $n quest 5 4 1
endif
~
>death_prog 100~
if quest(5, 4, $n) == 7
  mpoload 5705
  mpoload 5706
  mpmset $n long $n Betrayer of Hartsvale is here.
  mpmset $n quest 5 4 8
endif
~
